    "ssky_text_column_QdRNaJ": {
      "type": "ssky-text-column",
      "blocks": {
        "text_DGQwfW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "text": "<p>Our books for younger children make reading engaging, fun, and exciting while teaching valuable lifelong lessons. Here are the benefits of choosing books from our collection:</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "text_column_HD9tXL": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Promote Critical Thinking Early</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>These books go beyond surface-level stories. They introduce key economic, civic, and moral concepts in a way young readers can understand and question.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_LYdYjF": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Values That Align With Your Family</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Tuttle Twins stories focus on principles like responsibility, honesty, and freedom. They're designed for families who want more than just fluff in their children’s reading time.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_TUXkH4": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Vibrant Illustrations and Clear Language</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Our books use bright, inviting artwork to keep kids engaged. The language is simple enough for early readers, yet rich enough to challenge and inspire.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_KCE8zm": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Great for Shared Reading</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Reading aloud with your 5-year-old or letting your 8-year-old read independently is easy with these books, which work perfectly for all little ones. They’re written for flexible reading styles.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_TB6xrk": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Support Learning at Home</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p><strong>E</strong>ach book reinforces what many homeschool and alternative education families already value: liberty, entrepreneurship, and sound reasoning.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_t8abcN": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Built-In Conversation Starters</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>At the end of each book, you’ll find questions and topics to help you talk through the big ideas with your kids. It’s learning made easy for parents and fun for children.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        }
      },
